DESCRIPTION:Sociocracy For All\n<p>A beginner-friendly session on sociocra
 cy — a consent-based\, shared-power system for making decisions together
  — for Unitarian Universalist leaders\, staff\, and congregants. We\\'ll
  cover the basics\, hear real examples from UU settings\, and leave with i
 deas for your own community and what next steps you can take.</p>\\n\nLang
 uage: Not specified\nLanguage requirements: Not specified\nInterpretation:
