DESCRIPTION:Sociocracy For All\n<p>How can sociocracy create a culture whe
 re all voices can be heard\, disagreement is welcome\, and people feel com
 fortable to be themselves? This training will highlight how the concepts o
 f psychological safety and generative conflict can be intentionally cultiv
 ated through your facilitation and implementation of sociocracy.</p>\\n\nL
 anguage: Not specified\nLanguage requirements: Not specified\nInterpretati
